# Frontend

- Pages: `login.html`, `courses.html`, `course.html` + shared `js/api.js`, `css/app.css`
- Auth: `requireAuth()` + `api()` from `/js/api.js` (Bearer JWT, JSON errors)
- No frameworks; keep UI minimal cards matching existing CSS classes
- Talk to API via Vite proxy (`/api` → `8081`); never hardcode OpenRouter keys in browser
- Prefer `async` handlers with `try/catch` and `#err` / `#ok` messages like `course.html`

## Antipatterns

- ❌ `console.log` of tokens or PII left in UI code
- ❌ Duplicating `fetch` auth headers instead of `api()`
- ❌ Adding React/Vue/TS without an explicit request
